# Tests

Tests use `unittest.TestCase` and `unittest.mock`. Session tests patch miner I/O with `patched_io` in `test_autotune.py`. Leave the network and live miners out of tests.

Run `python -m unittest`.

```python
# BAD
import pytest

def test_live_board():
    requests.get("http://192.168.1.10/api/system/info")

# GOOD
class DecisionTests(unittest.TestCase):
    def test_overheat_steps_frequency_down(self):
        frequency, voltage, reason = autotune.decide_adjustment(**_limits(temp=75))
        self.assertLess(frequency, 700)
```
